loom roster cold_guards=58 cold_green=58 rostered_now=60
file tools/fixtures/witness_reach_scan.sh the meter -- four readings from one invocation-position rule, roots read off the roster
file tools/fixtures/witness_reach_control.sh eighteen behaviors on planted git repositories, the ceiling from three positions
